  "title": "Consciousness depends only on the present state",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "f37f7c69-3794-4f52-806c-71ce6bc9427f",
      "text": "When local-state sufficiency and causal efficacy hold, consciousness attribution cannot depend irreducibly on prior history: with $X_t$ fixed, the attribution is the same across every history $X_{<t}$, so it must be state-based, $C_t = f(X_t)$.",
